-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CCFULL-ROM training input.  The lines are read in order; blank lines and lines
starting with # are skipped, and everything after line 17 is ignored.  Paths
are relative to the project root.

 1-9  CCFULL input of the reaction (CCFULL manual).  Line 3 is the rotor
      record E2T,beta2,beta4,beta6,NrotT.
 10   model_id: name of the trained model and of its directories in
      training_data and outputs.  auto: aAP_zZP__aAT_zZT, e.g. a16_z8__a154_z62.
 11   experimental data file of this reaction.
 12   training_root: directory of the trained models.
 13   bounds of beta2, beta4, beta6: lower,upper of each.  Equal bounds fix
      a parameter, e.g. 0.0,0.0 for beta6.
 14   bounds of V0 (MeV), r0 (fm), a0 (fm), as line 13.
 15   energy range of the model; any energy inside it can be emulated.
      experimental: the measured energies of line 11, rounded outward to MeV.
      ccfull: Emin and Emax of line 8.  Or lower,upper in MeV, e.g. 52.0,100.0.
 16   snapshots, basis rank, seed, CCFULL processes at a time.  The snapshots
      are Latin-hypercube points in (beta2, beta4, beta6, V0, r0, a0, E, J),
      one exact CCFULL solve each; J is drawn from the partial waves CCFULL
      needs at that energy.  The basis keeps that many POD modes of them, and
      each online (E, J) solve is a rank x rank system.
 17   CC-EIM of the coupling field: parameter points (potential evaluations
      only), seed, tolerance, maximum modes per multipole.
